    <!-- About -->
    <string name="about_version_label">Version 1.2.0</string>
    <string name="about_dev_info">Crafted with native Android APIs (WindowManager, AccessibilityService, Foreground Service, DynamicAnimation, and Material Design 3).</string>
    <string name="about_privacy_title">Privacy &amp; Transparency Policy</string>
    <string name="about_privacy_body">TouchFlow operates 100% locally on your device.\n\n• Zero Data Collection: TouchFlow does not collect, store, transmit, or share personal data, keystrokes, screen contents, or usage analytics.\n\n• Accessibility Service Usage: Used exclusively for user-initiated global actions (Home, Back, Recent Apps, Screenshot, Lock Screen, Minimize, Notifications, Quick Settings, Power Dialog) and reading active package names for MiniMax. Window content retrieval is disabled.\n\n• Overlay &amp; Foreground Service: Used while TouchFlow is enabled to keep the floating assistant visible even when the main app task is closed.\n\n• Package Queries: Used only to select favorite app shortcuts and MiniMax app rules.</string>

